Both seeders mass-assign via ItemCampaign::firstOrCreate([...]) — the exact 17-field $fillable
list is what makes these succeed instead of silently dropping fields (Laravel's default
$fillable behavior drops unlisted keys rather than throwing, so a green run here is the correct
proof, not just "no exception").

